{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, what's up? It's been a few days since we talked. How have you been? Life's been tough lately - my son had a soccer accident last Saturday and hurt his ankle, it was tough seeing him hurt! I just been looking after him and taking him to the doctor. As a dad, it's hard to watch your kid go through something like that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-0a6e9deaa8267a5d5dec088a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:23.936366+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0a6e9deaa8267a5d5dec088a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0a6e9deaa8267a5d5dec088a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, sorry to hear about what happened. I can imagine how hard it must have been for you. Things haven't been easy for me either. Had a tough week and a doc's appointment, so it was kinda like a wake-up call to take better care of myself. On a bright side, I'm taking a cooking class to learn how to make healthier meals."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-6b41f8ff0b7f99b1d00658af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:23.964520+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6b41f8ff0b7f99b1d00658af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6b41f8ff0b7f99b1d00658af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, sorry to hear you had a rough week. At least it's forcing us both to take better care of ourselves, right? I hear the class you're taking is packed with healthy recipes. How's it been going? Have you picked up any yummy new meals?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-671186c85bb862688d700a9d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:23.981392+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "671186c85bb862688d700a9d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "671186c85bb862688d700a9d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: The cooking class has been great, I've learned awesome recipes. Last night I made this yummy grilled dish, so good!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-ed747e28997c43fed70ce835", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:23.997340+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed747e28997c43fed70ce835", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed747e28997c43fed70ce835", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Mmm, it looks delicious! What did you put in it? I want to eat healthy, so what kind of recipes do you suggest?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-2756701e4742360323dc5973", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.008615+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2756701e4742360323dc5973", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2756701e4742360323dc5973", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! I marinated it with a few different ingredients and grilled it with some veggies. It turned out really flavorful! If you want, I can share more recipes from my cooking class. Just let me know what you're looking for!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-728185cc2eaba3c1c11c10fa", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.020063+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "728185cc2eaba3c1c11c10fa", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "728185cc2eaba3c1c11c10fa", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: That'd be great, Sam! I'm looking to add more vegetables to my meals. Do you have any recipes for that?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-9efcb364bc02224ab0d49704", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.038256+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9efcb364bc02224ab0d49704", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9efcb364bc02224ab0d49704", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yeah definitely, Evan. I have a tasty and easy roasted veg recipe that I can share with you. Oh, by the way, how have you been doing after the soccer incident? Must've been tough."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-26604c868ec380f339287ed8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.047444+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "26604c868ec380f339287ed8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "26604c868ec380f339287ed8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. His ankle is getting better, but still sore. It was rough at first, but thank goodness it was nothing serious."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-39a4f8ec1f8dec8245b0d300", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.061748+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "39a4f8ec1f8dec8245b0d300", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "39a4f8ec1f8dec8245b0d300", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Glad to hear his ankle is getting better. It's hard seeing someone we care about hurt. Look after yourself too, yeah? We gotta look after our health."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-a53ab34e27711666d1127884", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.074488+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a53ab34e27711666d1127884", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a53ab34e27711666d1127884", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yep, taking care of ourselves is a must. How have you been feeling lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-0192335bd2b8a88f130b68f5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.086662+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0192335bd2b8a88f130b68f5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0192335bd2b8a88f130b68f5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: I have been feeling a mix of emotions - somewhat concerned about my health but also motivated to make positive changes. Taking things one step at a time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-bf0081cfd62b38a2a0777014", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.097412+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bf0081cfd62b38a2a0777014", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bf0081cfd62b38a2a0777014", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's okay to feel overwhelmed, Sam. Just keep moving forward slowly and taking small steps. You're doing awesome."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-45cdfaee003ba545d5ef77ce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.108409+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "45cdfaee003ba545d5ef77ce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "45cdfaee003ba545d5ef77ce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan, your encouragement means a lot to me. I'll keep going and take it one step at a time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-f9078bb11d2a107d0a6bec54", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.121851+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f9078bb11d2a107d0a6bec54", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f9078bb11d2a107d0a6bec54", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: No worries, just keep going and taking it one step at a time! You'll get there."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-7d25d12eb92590869daf07af", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.132112+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7d25d12eb92590869daf07af", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7d25d12eb92590869daf07af", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan. I really appreciate that. It means a lot."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_7-f5bf895619bdd56f1e759314", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:02:24.144652+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5bf895619bdd56f1e759314", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5bf895619bdd56f1e759314", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
